// N3 listening content: Listening Lab scenes (N3_DIALOGUES) and Numbers & Time items (N3_NUMBER_SCENES).
// Same shapes as DIALOGUES and NUMBER_SCENES in practice-data.js. All original writing.
// N3 scenes run at natural speed and length (6-12 lines). Scenes marked `gist: true` are 概要理解 (summary)
// items: a monologue or longer exchange whose questions ask for the main point or the speaker's opinion.
// Words whose kanji are outside the allowed N5/N4/N3 lists stay in kana (師匠, 練習, 覚える, わすれる…).
